message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper it accompanies."
title: "Reproduction code for: The Independence Assumption for Rounding Errors in Block Floating Point"
abstract: >-
  Simulation and high-precision quadrature scripts producing every numerical
  result of the accompanying paper: the failure of the zero-mean and
  uncorrelatedness assumptions for block floating point rounding errors, the
  exact variance laws, and the parameter-free reduced model.
